profile.summary:
Full stack web developer with a background in data network engineering and project management in the biotech area. As a result of my diverse career in IT, I bring a unique mix of technology skills and business expertise.  As a developer, these skills allow me to effectively prioritize tasks when working independently as well as quickly integrate into new team-based initiatives. 

I've demonstrated proficiency with the following:

• JavaScript, Ruby on Rails, jQuery and AJAX;
• HTML/CSS;
• Sass and Bootstrap;
• SQL (specifically PostgreSQL).

Operating Systems:
• MacOS;
• MS Windows (client & server OS);
• Unix (including SunOS, Solaris, and AIX).

On a personal note, I'm fluent in both English as well as Spanish and hold an FAA Part 107 rating for commercial drone flights  The 107 came about because of my interest in photography and video content creation.  As such, it allows me to combine aerial imagery to my projects.

